    "title": "South Street Oktoberfest Turns 18, Brings 1,000-Seat Biergarten to Philly - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joshua Doyle ,\n1 days ago South Street is about to smell like pretzels, sausages and spilled beer. Brauhaus Schmitz is hosting the 18th annual South Street Oktoberfest on Saturday, running from noon to 8 p.m. on the 700 block of South Street, with nearly a dozen German beers, Bavarian food and a liter-lifting contest all part of the free, all-ages celebration. Read full article\n1",
